  "summary_en": "Singapore Ministry of Law's non-binding guide on responsible use of generative AI in legal services. It sets principles on professional ethics, confidentiality and transparency, offers a five-step implementation framework, and provides sample policies, clauses and vendor checklists. No robotics or physical AI content.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Legal professionals remain fully accountable for GenAI-assisted work product and must verify outputs.",
   "Apply risk-based, proportionate human oversight (human-in-the-loop or on-the-loop).",
   "Protect client confidentiality via tool selection, vendor terms review, anonymisation and no model training on client data.",
   "Consider disclosing GenAI use to clients and offering opt-out.",
   "Five-step adoption framework with sample governance policy, engagement letter clauses and vendor checklist."
  ],
